<!-- Twangle "twang to tune" mark: a plucked string's wobble dies away into a straight line that ends in a
     dot (the string in tune). The wobble is a damped sine, y = 54 − 17·e^(−0.075t)·sin(2πt/13), drawn as
     cubic Béziers a quarter period long (Hermite form, within 0.25 units of the curve), then straight once it
     is under a unit. Drawn straight on the 108dp canvas; every bit of ink stays within 33dp of the centre,
     the safe zone that every launcher mask keeps. One colour, so it is also the themed (monochrome) icon. -->
